'''Blueberries''' are berries found in the [[Black Forest]] biome. Bushes can be harvested for 1 Blueberries, affected by [[Farming (Skill)]]. Bushes replenish after {{duration|18000}}. There is currently no way to replant berry bushes, and if they are destroyed they will not grow back. They can also be found randomly in barrels outside [[Abandoned Outpost#Greydwarf Tower|Greydwarf Tower]]s.

