'''Cloudberries''' are berries found growing on the ground in [[Plains]] [[Biomes|biome]]. Cloudberries will respawn after 300 minutes ({{duration|18000}}). Cloudberry plants will remain intact if ground cover is cleared with the hoe, but they will not regrow if destroyed.

